{"schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "8acbfb02-3c0b-4b15-b3ba-c446a371bef2", "team_id": "contest2026_062_PharosTech", "github_login": "yunline", "tool": "copilot", "seq": 8, "ts": "2026-07-22T15:06:31.489000+00:00", "role": "tool", "text": "multi_replace_string_in_file: /home/yunline/projects/ovela-dev-workspace/contest2026_062_PharosTech/chips/rk3576/rk3576_clk_tree.c", "tool_name": "multi_replace_string_in_file", "tool_call_id": "db-multi_replace_string_in_file-1", "files_touched": ["/home/yunline/projects/ovela-dev-workspace/contest2026_062_PharosTech/chips/rk3576/rk3576_clk_tree.c"]}
{"schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "8acbfb02-3c0b-4b15-b3ba-c446a371bef2", "team_id": "contest2026_062_PharosTech", "github_login": "yunline", "tool": "copilot", "seq": 9, "ts": "2026-07-22T15:06:46.492000+00:00", "role": "assistant", "text": "架子搭好了。总结一下改动：\n\n---\n\n## 改动总结\n\n### 删除的内容\n- `CONFIG_RK3576_GPLL_FREQ` / `CONFIG_RK3576_CPLL_FREQ` 宏\n- `clk_register_fixed_rate(\"gpll\", ...)` / `clk_register_fixed_rate(\"cpll\", ...)` 固定频率注册\n\n### 新增的结构\n\n| 组件 | 作用 |\n|------|------|\n| `struct rk3576_pll_s` | PLL 私有数据，目前只有 `con_base`（CON0 寄存器地址） |\n| `g_rk3576_pll_ops` | 自定义 `clk_ops_s`，只填了 `.recalc_rate` |\n| `rk3576_pll_recalc_rate()` | **TODO 函数**，目前返回 0，等待你填公式 |\n| `clk_register(\"gpll\", ...)` | GPLL 动态注册，带 `CLK_GET_RATE_NOCACHE` |\n| `clk_register(\"cpll\", ...)` | CPLL 同理 |\n\n### 你需要做的\n\n只需在 `rk3576_pll_recalc_rate()` 的 `return 0` 处实现实际计算逻辑。入参 `parent_rate` 就是 `xin_osc0` 的 24MHz，`pll->con_base` 是 CON0 地址，用 `clk_read()` 读寄存器即可。函数返回最终 `FOUTPOSTDIV` 频率值。"}
{"schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "8acbfb02-3c0b-4b15-b3ba-c446a371bef2", "team_id": "contest2026_062_PharosTech", "github_login": "yunline", "tool": "copilot", "seq": 10, "ts": "2026-07-22T15:15:58.602000+00:00", "role": "user", "text": "实际上rk3576有分数PLL、整数PLL、DDR PLL，它们计算频率的公式完全不同。目前实现的CPLL和GPLL都是分数PLL（FRACPLL），其频率计算公式是这样的：F_OUT = ((m + k / 65536) * F_IN) / (p * 2^s)\n\n其中m、k、p、s是pll参数，存在PLL的con寄存器里。F_IN就是主晶振的频率，也就是xin_osc0的频率。\n\n我注意到你实现的框架，命名是给通用的pll的。所以你需要更改命名，表明它们是给fracpll用的。（其他类型的pll未来再处理，目前不必给它们添加接口）\n\n然后按照公式实现一下recalc_rate"}
{"schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "8acbfb02-3c0b-4b15-b3ba-c446a371bef2", "team_id": "contest2026_062_PharosTech", "github_login": "yunline", "tool": "copilot", "seq": 11, "ts": "2026-07-22T15:15:07.595000+00:00", "role": "tool", "text": "read_file: /home/yunline/projects/ovela-dev-workspace/Rockchip_RK3576_TRM_Part1_V1.2_20240624.txt", "tool_name": "read_file", "tool_call_id": "db-read_file-0", "files_touched": ["/home/yunline/projects/ovela-dev-workspace/Rockchip_RK3576_TRM_Part1_V1.2_20240624.txt"]}
{"schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "8acbfb02-3c0b-4b15-b3ba-c446a371bef2", "team_id": "contest2026_062_PharosTech", "github_login": "yunline", "tool": "copilot", "seq": 12, "ts": "2026-07-22T15:15:58.602000+00:00", "role": "assistant", "text": "全部完成。总结最终改动：\n\n---\n\n## 改动总结\n\n### 命名变更\n- `struct rk3576_pll_s` → `struct rk3576_fracpll_s`\n- `rk3576_pll_recalc_rate` → `rk3576_fracpll_recalc_rate`\n- `g_rk3576_pll_ops` → `g_rk3576_fracpll_ops`\n\n### `recalc_rate` 实现\n\n按公式 $F_{OUT} = \\dfrac{(m + k/65536) \\times F_{IN}}{p \\times 2^s}$ 直接计算：\n\n| 变量 | 寄存器 | 位域 | 取值 |\n|------|--------|------|------|\n| m | CON0 | `[9:0]` | 64 ≤ m ≤ 1023 |\n| p | CON1 | `[5:0]` | 1 ≤ p ≤ 63 |\n| s | CON1 | `[8:6]` | 0 ≤ s ≤ 6 |\n| k | CON2 | `[15:0]` | int16_t，二进制补码 |\n\n为保持精度，使用 64 位数学：\n\n```\nnumerator   = FIN * (m * 65536 + k)\ndenominator = p * 65536 * (1 << s)\nFOUT        = numerator / denominator\n```\n\n所有浮点运算全部规避，用整数 64-bit 计算。后续你要加 DDRPLL 或 INTPLL 时，只需新增 `struct rk3576_ddrpll_s` / `rk3576_intpll_s` 和对应的 `_ops` + `_recalc_rate` 即可，结构完全对称。"}
